
--- [GIAI CHI TIET] PHEP CONG ---
Buoc 1: Chuyen doi chuoi bit thanh da thuc tren GF(2):
  A = 0
  B = x^3 + x^2 + x + 1
Buoc 2: Thuc hien phep toan:
  Ket qua A + B = x^3 + x^2 + x + 1
Buoc 3: Ket qua he Nhi phan: 1111

--- [GIAI CHI TIET] PHEP CONG ---
Buoc 1: Chuyen doi chuoi bit thanh da thuc tren GF(2):
  A = x^7 + x^6 + x^5 + x^4 + x^3 + x^2 + x + 1
  B = x^7 + x^6 + x^5 + x^4 + x^3 + x^2 + x + 1
Buoc 2: Thuc hien phep toan:
  Ket qua A + B = 0
Buoc 3: Ket qua he Nhi phan: 00000000

--- [GIAI CHI TIET] PHEP NHAN ---
Buoc 1: Chuyen doi chuoi bit thanh da thuc tren GF(2):
  A = x^6 + 1
  B = x + 1
Buoc 2: Thuc hien phep toan:
  Ket qua A * B = x^7 + x^6 + x + 1
Buoc 3: Ket qua he Nhi phan: 11000011

--- [GIAI CHI TIET] PHEP NHAN ---
Buoc 1: Chuyen doi chuoi bit thanh da thuc tren GF(2):
  A = x^3 + x^2 + x + 1
  B = x^3 + x^2 + x + 1
Buoc 2: Thuc hien phep toan:
  Ket qua A * B = x^6 + x^4 + x^2 + 1
Buoc 3: Ket qua he Nhi phan: 1010101

--- [GIAI CHI TIET] PHEP CHIA LAY THUONG ---
Buoc 1: Chuyen doi chuoi bit thanh da thuc tren GF(2):
  A = x^5 + x^4 + x^3 + x^2 + x + 1
  B = x^2 + 1
Buoc 2: Thuc hien phep toan:
  Ket qua A / B = x^3 + x^2
Buoc 3: Ket qua he Nhi phan: 1100

--- [GIAI CHI TIET] PHEP CHIA LAY DU ---
Buoc 1: Chuyen doi chuoi bit thanh da thuc tren GF(2):
  A = x^5 + x^4 + x^3 + x^2 + x + 1
  B = x^2 + 1
Buoc 2: Thuc hien phep toan:
  Ket qua A % B = x + 1
Buoc 3: Ket qua he Nhi phan: 11

--- [GIAI CHI TIET] KIEM TRA DA THUC TOI GIAN ---
Da thuc can kiem tra: f(x) = x^4 + x^3 + x^2 + x + 1
Ap dung thuat toan Ben-Or test tren GF(2)...
Ket luan: f(x) LA da thuc bat kha quy.

--- [GIAI CHI TIET] KIEM TRA DA THUC TOI GIAN ---
Da thuc can kiem tra: f(x) = x^4 + x^2 + 1
Ap dung thuat toan Ben-Or test tren GF(2)...
Ket luan: f(x) KHONG PHAI LA da thuc bat kha quy.